#. Tag: emphasis
#: details-institutions.docbook:204
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "NOTE: You must have a file open before you can create a new institution. "
#| "If you do not have an existing file, you will need to create a <link "
#| "linkend=\"firsttime.3\">new file</link>."
msgid ""
"NOTE: You must have a file open before you can create a new institution. If "
"you do not have an existing file, you will need to <link linkend="
"\"firsttime.3\">create one</link>."
msgstr ""
"BILJEŠKA: Morate imati otvorenu datoteku prije nego što možete napraviti "
"novu instituciju. Ukoliko nemate postojuću datoteku, morate kreirati <link "
"linkend=\"firsttime.3\">novu datoteku</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-institutions.docbook:211
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Only the name is required in the New Institution Dialog, all other fields "
#| "are optional. As with the personal information dialog, this data is not "
#| "currently used by &kappname;, but will be required by future releases for "
#| "certain features. In particular, the Routing Number and the "
#| "<acronym><ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_9362\">BIC (Bank "
#| "Identifier Code)</ulink></acronym> will be required for online banking."
msgid ""
"Only the name is required in the New Institution Dialog, all other fields "
"are optional. As with the personal information dialog, this data is not "
"currently used by &kmymoney;, but will be required by future releases for "
"certain features. In particular, the Routing Number and the <acronym><ulink "
"url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_9362\">BIC (Bank Identifier Code)</"
"ulink></acronym> will be required for online banking."
msgstr ""
"Samo je ime potrebno u Dijalogu Nove Institucije, sva ostala polja su "
"opcionalna. Kao sa dijalogom ličnih informacija, ovi podaci se trenutno ne "
"koriste od strane &kappname;, ali će biti potrebni za buduću izdanja "
"određenih opcija. Npr., Broj Usmjeravanja i <acronym><ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_9362\">BIC (Bank Identifier Code - kod za "
"identificiranje banke)</ulink></acronym> će biti potrebni za internet "
"bankarstvo."

#. Tag: title
#: details-institutions.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "Account Options"
msgstr "Opcije računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-institutions.docbook:225
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Right-clicking an account name brings up an Account Options sub-menu. "
#| "Selecting <guimenuitem>New account...</guimenuitem> steps you through the "
#| "new account process. Selecting <guimenuitem>Open Ledger</guimenuitem> "
#| "brings you directly to the Ledgers view or Investments view, depending on "
#| "the account type. Simply double-clicking an account name also opens the "
#| "account. Selecting <guimenuitem>Edit account</guimenuitem> brings up a "
#| "window allowing you to change an account's name, start date, associated "
#| "banking institution, and parent account. Deleting an account is only "
#| "possible if there are no transactions associated with that account. "
#| "Selecting <guimenuitem>Reconcile...</guimenuitem> opens up the Reconcile "
#| "Wizard, which steps you through the process of comparing your bank "
#| "account statements to your electronic entries. More details, as well as "
#| "information about the other options is presented in the appropriate "
#| "sections of this manual."
msgid ""
"Right-clicking an account name brings up an Account Options sub-menu. "
"Selecting <guimenuitem>New account...</guimenuitem> steps you through the "
"new account process. Selecting <guimenuitem>Open Ledger</guimenuitem> brings "
"you directly to the Ledgers view or Investments view, depending on the "
"account type. Simply double-clicking an account name also opens the account. "
"Selecting <guimenuitem>Edit account</guimenuitem> brings up a window "
"allowing you to change an account's name, start date, associated banking "
"institution, and parent account. Deleting an account is only possible if "
"there are no transactions associated with that account, and the account is "
"not referred to in any scheduled transaction. Selecting "
"<guimenuitem>Reconcile...</guimenuitem> opens up the Reconcile Wizard, which "
"steps you through the process of comparing your account statement to your "
"electronic entries. More details, as well as information about the other "
"options, are presented in the appropriate sections of this manual."
msgstr ""
"Desni klik na ime računa otvara podmeni opcija računa. Odabir "
"<guimenuitem>Novi račun...</guimenuitem> će vas provesti kroz proces "
"kreiranja novog računa. Odabir <guimenuitem>Otvori knjigu</guimenuitem> vas "
"vodi direktno to glavnog pregleda ili investicionog pregleda u ovisnoti od "
"tipa računa. Jednostavno duplim klikom na ime računa također otvara račun. "
"Odabir <guimenuitem>Edit account</guimenuitem> otvara prozor koji vam "
"omogućava da promijenite ime računa, datum početka, povezane bankovne "
"institucije i roditeljski račun. Brisanje računa je moguće samo ako nema "
"transakcija povezanih sa računom. Odabir <guimenuitem>Uparivanje...</"
"guimenuitem> otvara Čarobnjaka Izmirenja koji vas vodi kroz proces poređenja "
"izjava bankovnog računa sa vašm elektronskim unosima. Više detalja, kao i "
"informacije o drugim opcijama je prikazano u odgovarajućim sekcijama ovog "
"priručnika."

